  "replacement_protocol": [
    "Same solver, endpoint, judge (gpt-4o-2024-11-20 only) and budget as the incumbent unless that variable is what is being tested.",
    "A candidate replaces the incumbent only with a real gain over F0-direct on professional questions (held-out paired CI above 0, or a strictly better exact/verifiability metric with content quality not worse).",
    "Tune only on the development split (AdjQA cohort500, DRB L1-L3 / pilot cases); confirm once on the held-out split and report that number.",
    "Report the paired difference against F0-direct and against the incumbent, with 95% CI, win/tie/loss and tokens.",
    "If adj_partner or environment changed, run `scripts/harness_freeze.py verify`, rerun the affected direct+harness arms on the new code, then `snapshot`.",
    "Target-revealing guidance is allowed only in slots labelled controlled (AdjCase-PLGA) and must be stated as such.",
    "To swap: move the old incumbent into history, write the candidate as incumbent, append a revisions entry with date, reason and run path."
  ],
